<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 18,708 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 18,708 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main Chittagong port handled 18,708 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours ending 1.00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Monday compared to 16,689 tonnes during the same period on Sunday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					 Monday		  Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   3,736		   2,201</p>
<p>    Import cargo		  14,972		  14,488</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes	Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>    Cement		 20,000     Golden sunlight  30/9</p>
<p>    Wheat		  25,000     Akadan Bulk	1/10</p>
<p>    Sugar		  13,000     Mare		 3/10</p>
<p>    Peas		   22,925     Nand sristi	5/10</p>
<p>    Fertilizer	   25,559     INCE-B	     11/10</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
